# The player on ground whose tile behaviour has bits 4 and 7 set
# ($81:CE86, called from the player's code at $81:CD87 in levels with
# $035C = 4): GroundBehindBit4 returns C set and the speed steps the
# other way ($81:CEC5). The behaviour tables of the level pw4.state
# starts hold no such tile where the player walks. Played as
# rand_pw4_1.box, with every behaviour byte at $7E:C800-$7E:D7FF that has
# bit 4 set and bit 7 clear given bit 7 after its first lines.
